---
description:
  Edges into, out of and across a subgraph placed in its own grid cell, with a
  member placed inside the subgraph's grid.
config:
  layout: grid
  securityLevel: loose
  grid:
    rowGap: 72
    columnGap: 96
---
flowchart LR
  O["Outside"]@{ row: 1, column: 1 }
  subgraph G["Group"]
    M["Member"]@{ row: 1, column: 1 }
  end
  G@{ row: 1, column: 2 }

  G --> M
  O --> G
  O --> M
